            "review_text": "Tiffany Thuy\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam38 contributions\n0\nNice place! A bit noisy but good seafood!\nJun 2019 • Friends\nWell i pass by coincidence bc my goat meat restaurant nearby close down. I ordered squid bbq & crunchy fried noodle with seafood! The taste is amazing & fresh! U can’t lie if seafood not fresh! Don’t try tom yum hot pot: it is much coconut milk & not tomym taste at all! Service is friendly & cheerful. We are 3 office woman eating not much (50$) i guess! Compare with all sexy ladies & wealth book urgly look guy next table. But they serve us equally. Very appriciate that! Will come back & update real pic soon\nRead more\nWritten June 28, 2019",
